---

## 1. Executive summary

| Layer | Status | Score |
|-------|--------|-------|
| Platform SDK + multi-tenant | **Done** (PR-0..3) | 9/10 |
| Denali 4-block engineering | **Done** (code + smoke) | 8.5/10 |
| Visual polish | **Done** (PR-4) | ~7/10 |
| Competitive full landing (16 sections) | **Planned** (PR-4..8) | 0/10 → target 9/10 |

**Truth:** v7 spec intentionally shipped **foundation-first** (4 blocks). Industry outdoor/tour landings use **12–16 sections** (hero storytelling, why-us, FAQ, footer, sticky CTA). This plan closes that gap **without** breaking ADR-MKT-004 or fake stats.

