## 3. Target page map (top → bottom)

Denali **full** landing when all phases complete:

```text
┌─ L0 GLOBAL CHROME ─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Header (glass/blur, sticky CTA, scroll progress opt.) │
│  Mobile drawer (nav · member · locale · CTA)           │
├─ L1 HERO STORYTELLING ─────────────────────────────────┤
│  Visual (image/video + scrim + grain)                  │
│  Headline · sub · primary + secondary CTA              │
│  Trust micro-badge (copy only — no fake numbers)       │
│  Hero search (mock → catalog query)                    │
│  Floating cards (API: next tour · seats — optional)    │
├─ L2 TOURS & DISCOVERY ─────────────────────────────────┤
│  Latest / upcoming (bento or carousel — catalog)       │
│  Category explorer (manifest/API tags)                 │
│  Destination explorer (phase 2 · map later)            │
├─ L3 TRUST & BRAND ─────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Why Denali (bento: guide · safety · gear · community) │
│  Tour journey timeline (register → summit → return)    │
│  Testimonials (real quotes; video phase 2)             │
│  Adventure gallery (real tour photos)                  │
├─ L4 DEPTH & SEO ───────────────────────────────────────┤
│  FAQ accordion (+ FAQPage JSON-LD)                     │
│  Equipment / checklist (static i18n phase 1)           │
│  Blog teaser (3 posts — when CMS exists)               │
├─ L5 CLOSE ─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Final CTA band (full-bleed)                           │
│  Footer (brand · tours · resources · contact · legal)  │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Urban / guest-club **minimal** (unchanged until P16): Shell + title + lead + single CTA.

