## 4. Phase roadmap (PR-4 → PR-8)

### Overview

| Phase | Product goal | SDK touch | Primary deliverable |
|-------|--------------|-----------|---------------------|
| **PR-4** | Cinematic MVP visual | None | hero.webp, card covers, CSS polish |
| **PR-5** | Chrome + trust + SEO base | `sections.faq` · `footer` | ✅ drawer, FAQ, footer |
| **PR-6** | Brand story | `sections.whySection` · `journey` · `testimonials` | ✅ done 2026-07-04 |
| **PR-7** | Discovery | **guestLanding v2** + catalog API | ✅ featured, categories, destinations, hero search |
| **PR-8** | Premium + excellence | SEO manifest | ✅ gallery, equipment, skip link, home JSON-LD, Lighthouse `/` |

---

### PR-4 — Visual foundation (2–3 days)

**Goal:** 3.5 → 7/10 visual without new sections.

| Item | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Assets | `public/home/hero.webp` (≤200KB), optional `hero-og.webp` |
| CSS | Cinematic hero scrim, Calistoga scale ≥1024px, card cover-first |
| Latest | Hide scrollbar desktop, scroll-snap mobile, hover lift |
| Trust / Final | Designed bands (not thin strip) |
| Skill | [`marketing-landing-visual.mdoc`](./marketing-landing-visual.mdoc) CP-SKILL |

**Tests:** lint · HOME-UNIT-* · guest-theme-stack · guard-home-hooks · smoke optional

**Do not:** new manifest fields · new hooks · client JS libraries

---

### PR-5 — Global chrome + FAQ + footer (3–5 days)

**Goal:** Professional site shell; first “complete page” feel.

| Section | Hooks (new) | Notes |
|---------|-------------|-------|
| Header v2 | `data-marketing-header` (enhance) | glass, blur, shadow on scroll, sticky CTA |
| Mobile drawer | `data-marketing-nav-drawer` | nav, member, locale, CTA |
| FAQ | `data-marketing-home-faq` | accordion, 6–8 Denali questions, FAQ schema |
| Footer | `data-marketing-footer` | 4 columns + social + newsletter stub |

**i18n:** `home.full.faq.*`, `home.full.footer.*`

**Manifest (optional v2 preview):**

```json
"sections": {
  "headerEnhanced": true,
  "faq": true,
  "footer": true
}
```

**Tests:** SMK-MKT-HOME-07 (footer visible) · SMK-MKT-HOME-08 (drawer a11y) · extend guard

---

### PR-6 — Brand story blocks (4–6 days)

**Goal:** Answer “why Denali?” — competitive differentiation.

| Section | Hook | Data source |
|---------|------|-------------|
| Why Denali bento | `data-marketing-home-why` | i18n tiles (guide, safety, equipment, community) |
| Tour journey | `data-marketing-home-journey` | i18n timeline steps |
| Testimonials | `data-marketing-home-testimonials` | i18n + optional `branding` / future CMS |

**Motion:** CSS-only reveals; `prefers-reduced-motion` required. One motion language doc in `design-system/denali-club/pages/home.md`.

**SDK:** `guestLanding.sections` += `whySection`, `journey`, `testimonials`
(canonical gate; former `whyDenali` alias expired — PSR-4b-whyDenali-alias-expiry)

**Tests:** HOME-UNIT-05 (section gates) · SMK-MKT-HOME-05 unchanged for urban

---

### PR-7 — Discovery layer (5–8 days, API-dependent)

**Goal:** Browse intent on `/` not only `/tours`.

| Section | Hook | Dependency |
|---------|------|------------|
| Featured bento | `data-marketing-home-featured` | catalog sort + cover URLs |
| Category explorer | `data-marketing-home-categories` | catalog `category` filter or manifest taxonomy |
| Destination cards | `data-marketing-home-destinations` | exposure API / static seed dev |
| Hero search | `data-marketing-home-search` | query → `/tours?city=&…` |

**Rules:** no “featured” curation API in MVP — bento uses **same catalog sort** with layout variant only (R10). Categories only if filter exists in API.

**SDK:** sections += `featuredLayout`, `categories`, `destinations`, `heroSearch`

---

### PR-8 — Premium + 10/10 closure (5–10 days)

| Item | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Gallery masonry | `data-marketing-home-gallery` — photos from published tours |
| Blog teaser | `data-marketing-home-blog` — when route/API exists |
| Equipment | `data-marketing-home-equipment` — static checklist |
| JSON-LD | WebSite + ItemList on `/` (P14) |
| Lighthouse CI | `/` in lighthouserc (P8) |
| Skip link | P7 |
| Per-tenant hero | P9 branding URL |

**Community stats:** only if real API (member count) — else **forbidden** (R5).

