## 5. guestLanding manifest v2 (proposed)

Extend denali manifest; urban stays minimal (all false).

```json
"guestLanding": {
  "variant": "full",
  "i18nProfile": "full",
  "sections": {
    "hero": true,
    "heroSearch": false,
    "latestTours": true,
    "latestToursLimit": 6,
    "featuredLayout": "carousel",
    "categories": false,
    "destinations": false,
    "whySection": false,
    "journey": false,
    "testimonials": false,
    "gallery": false,
    "faq": false,
    "equipment": false,
    "blogTeaser": false,
    "trust": true,
    "finalCta": true,
    "footer": false
  },
  "presentation": {
    "heroStyle": "cinematic",
    "featuredLayout": "carousel",
    "motionProfile": "subtle"
  }
}
```

**Rollout:** PR-5 enables `faq`, `footer` · PR-6 enables story sections · PR-7 enables discovery · PR-8 enables gallery/blog.

**Generator:** extend `assertGuestLandingManifest` + `generateWorkspaceGuestLanding` (doc-first before code — ADR-GP-006 draft when PR-5 starts).

