## 7. Component inventory (marketing home)

Implement incrementally — do not build all at once.

| Tier | Components | Phase |
|------|------------|-------|
| T0 | HomeHero, HomeLatestTours, HomeTrust, HomeFinalCta | Done |
| T1 | MarketingHeaderEnhanced, MobileNavDrawer | PR-5 |
| T2 | HomeFaq, MarketingFooter | PR-5 |
| T3 | HomeWhyBento, HomeJourneyTimeline, HomeTestimonials | PR-6 |
| T4 | HomeFeaturedBento, HomeCategoryGrid, HomeDestinationCards, HomeSearchBar | PR-7 ✅ |
| T5 | HomeGallery, HomeBlogTeaser, HomeEquipment | PR-8 ✅ |

**Foundation reuse:** `CatalogCoverImage`, `buildCatalogTourMetaLine`, `fetchCatalogList`, Lucide icons.

**Client boundary budget:** max **1** (drawer OR carousel controller — prefer CSS scroll-snap).

---

## 8. Motion system (single language)

Define in `design-system/denali-club/pages/home.md`:

| Token | Use | Forbidden |
|-------|-----|-----------|
| `--mkt-motion-fast` | 150ms hover | >500ms loops |
| `--mkt-motion-reveal` | section enter (CSS) | scroll-jacking |
| `--mkt-lift-sm/md` | card hover | parallax full-page |
| `@media (prefers-reduced-motion)` | disable transforms | — |

Allowed: fade, slide-up reveal, lift, border glow on focus.  
Rejected: magnetic cursor, auto-play carousel, parallax mountains.

